[{"title":"赠翟公巽","author":"张耒","text":"我昔出守来丹阳，江流五月如探汤。\n使君之居在山腹，绕舍树石何青苍。\n千年药根蟠井底，灵液浸灌通寒浆。\n人言枸杞精变狗，夜吠往往闻空廊。\n金山荡潏浪花里，一舸遥去随鱼郎。\n最奇岩斋人迹少，乳水时滴白石床。\n翠鼋坡陀负日色，白蹢掀舞占风祥。\n我泊金山凡十日，穷探力取无遗忘。\n南风吹我渡江去，已厌淮南尘土黄。\n二十年间多少事，身如疲马起复僵。\n淮南穷栖众人后，朝食不充藜苋肠。\n公来衰颜得一笑，侧听高论惊寻常。\n穷阎过我坐至暮，满怀珠玉无秕糠。\n乃知世间有清议，未可尽以己意量。\n精金白璧天所宝，理无破碎委道旁。\n半年耳冷不闻此，过公矍然神激昂。\n论文自顾已老丑，从事理绝随飞翔。\n斯文有属不但尔，因公作诗我涕滂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53018,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠蔡彦规","author":"张耒","text":"我不见蔡子，杜门十日馀。\n今日叩我门，满手携琼琚。\n铿锵写我前，杂以贝与珠。\n我愕不知报，低头惊且吁。\n读毕致于怀，馀光溢衿裾。\n坐令箪瓢室，磊荦堆璠玙。\n我拙寡所合，甘为不材樗。\n嗟君何所闻，屡枉长者车。\n我来淮南游，霭霭子之誉。\n骅骝走千里，凡马安能逾。\n奈予不自量，痛鞭而疾驱。\n常忧过所往，疲惫伤吾躯。\n愿君少待我，且欲休吾驹。\n跳奔舍其群，子乐谁与俱。\n俯身援其类，是亦仁之徒。\n不然但用我，畏甚将逃逋。\n何如少待之，效技供子娱。\n我无功名愿，与世日益疏。\n反慕古沮溺，穷年事耕锄。\n皇皇吾夫子，忧世亦勤劬。\n虽然竟何就，孰若安以居。\n人生各有怀，未用相贤愚。\n得乐愿即止，安能较锱铢。\n又疑异所任，劳逸事亦殊。\n作歌以讯之，子意当何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53019,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"踵息斋","author":"张耒","text":"物之有知者恃息，物之有息知为贼。\n天长地久载元气，天地无心故无极。\n君知一身谁主持，六尘缘影工伎儿。\n发生变幻不暂止，令汝鼻息无停时。\n喘呼呀呷生至死，去今已远何由归。\n真人嗒然吾丧我，能使炎火为寒灰。\n中空无宰气不使，内自升降如灵龟。\n深之又深乃至踵，根深蒂固凝不动。\n超然内外无死地，梨枣华实龙虎用。\n真人示我尺素书，万卷丹经不劳诵。\n他年绿发对铜狄，却视吾斋真作梦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53020,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"襄阳曲","author":"张耒","text":"西津折苇鸣策策，蟾蜍光入芙蓉白。\n山头不雨贾船稀，日日门前江水窄。\n将欲烜赫招行人，旋起丹楼照长陌。\n银屏深蔽玉笙閒，自擘新橙饮北客。\n倏离暂合心未果，泪瑩双眸为谁堕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53021,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜后步西园","author":"张耒","text":"浓霜失暄妍，短日淡无色。\n回风振中园，摇落声策策。\n草根饥鸟啄，飞舞时啧啧。\n野荒无遗粒，卒岁将何食。\n鲜鲜西墙下，幽草弄寒碧。\n四时不吾欺，聊假汝顷刻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53022,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乾明院门望江山怀淮阳城南步二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"忆昨淮阳把酒，目前惟欠山林。\n江上云岑千垒，何为特地愁心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53023,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乾明院门望江山怀淮阳城南步二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"危台寺东野水，春来柳色鹅黄。\n江上沧波似屋，蛟龙作恶难量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53024,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书寺中所见四首 其四","author":"张耒","text":"闲里光阴最好，病多谈笑无多。\n梦幻世间种种，楞枷卷里消磨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53025,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书寺中所见四首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"江市樵苏早散，山家灯火常昏。\n纱帽支筇独立，龛中佛像无言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53026,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书寺中所见四首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"日出邻僧乞食，钟鸣老叟关门。\n谁见春宵净境，娟娟霁月当轩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53027,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言","author":"张耒","text":"青春要去便去，美酒得斟且斟。\n莫问世间蹀躞，须知老境侵寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53028,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白沙闸西舣舟亭下二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"客恨如云冉冉，风光似水迢迢。\n回首十年旧事，令人泪尽魂消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53029,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白沙闸西舣舟亭下二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"倦客时时醉眼，津亭日日春寒。\n目极伤春怀抱，黄昏犹在阑干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53030,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子瞻西太一宫祠二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"玉斝清晨荐酒，天风静夜飘香。\n凤吹管截孤竹，琴弦曲奏潇湘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53031,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子瞻西太一宫祠二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"太一祥储世世，祠宫岁事年年。\n绛节霓旌何处，松庭玉座萧然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53032,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐三首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"微寒骚屑窗竹，淡月朦胧夜天。\n路暗城头传警，漏稀更士高眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53033,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐三首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"灵通寺前老圃，畦蔬想见如云。\n谋拙嗟予飘泊，归来与尔知闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53034,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐三首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"门庭草草是客，寝室泠泠似僧。\n春寒犹须篝火，夜书颇复明灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53035,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋园杂感二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"世事我深谙委，人生他自奔忙。\n刻木牵丝作技，几回弄罢凄凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53036,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋园杂感二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"秋晚园林疏静，天高风日明鲜。\n中有支筇病客，三杯卯酒醺然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53037,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读潘郎文卷","author":"张耒","text":"霜鬓我犹谪宦，猬须子合封侯。\n老拙何劳咄咄，疏慵且复悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53038,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登山望海四首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"西望扬州何处，云中双塔巑岏。\n山外云涛断日，夕阳应近长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53039,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登山望海四首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"江阔风烟易晚，山高草木先秋。\n独倚阑干尽日，此身与世悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53040,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登山望海四首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"仕宦此身漫尔，功名已老茫然。\n山鸟不须惊客，相亲此复穷年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53041,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登山望海四首 其四","author":"张耒","text":"鸟去苍烟古木，人归绿野孤舟。\n信美虽非吾土，消忧且复登楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53042,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠广靖上人","author":"张耒","text":"七十庞眉禅客，曾见天衣老人。\n旃檀林中香气，悠然时有馀氤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53043,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"少年游","author":"张耒","text":"含羞倚醉不成歌。\n纤手掩香罗。\n偎花映烛，偷传深意，酒思入横波。\n看朱成碧心迷乱，翻脉脉、敛双蛾。\n相见时稀隔别多。\n又春尽、奈愁何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53044,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风流子","author":"张耒","text":"木叶亭皋下，重阳近，又是捣衣秋。\n奈愁入庾肠，老侵潘鬓，谩簪黄菊，花也应羞。\n楚天晚，白蘋烟尽处，红蓼水边头。\n芳草有情，夕阳无语，雁横南浦，人倚西楼。\n玉容知安否，香笺共锦字，两处悠悠。\n空恨碧云离合，青鸟沈浮。\n向风前懊恼，芳心一点，寸眉两叶，禁甚闲愁。\n情到不堪言处，分付东流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53045,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名 其二","author":"张耒","text":"菖蒲酒满劝人人，愿年年欢醉。\n偎倚。\n把合欢彩索，殷勤寄与。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53046,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名 其一 端五","author":"张耒","text":"水团冰浸砂糖裹。\n有透明角黍松儿和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53047,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名 其三","author":"张耒","text":"手把合欢彩索，殷勤微笑殢檀郎。\n低低告，不图系腕，图系人肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53048,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采莲子","author":"张耒","text":"菡萏香莲十顷陂，小姑贪戏采莲池。\n晚来弄水船头湿，更脱新裙裹鸭儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53049,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋蕊香","author":"张耒","text":"帘幕疏疏风透。\n一线香飘金兽。\n朱阑倚遍黄昏后。\n廊上月华如昼。\n别离滋味浓于酒。\n著人瘦。\n此情不及墙东柳。\n春色年年如旧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53050,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花","author":"张耒","text":"个人风味。\n只有江梅些子似。\n每到开时。\n满眼清愁只自知。\n霞裾仙佩。\n姑射神人风露态。\n蜂蝶休忙。\n不与春风一点香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53051,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳","author":"张耒","text":"裂楮裁筠，虚明潇洒，制成方丈屠苏。\n草团蒲坐，中置一山炉。\n拙似春林鸠宿，易于□、秋野鹑居。\n谁相对，时烦孟妇，石鼎煮寒蔬。\n嗟吁。\n人生随分足，风云际会，漫付伸舒。\n且偷取闲时，向此踌躇。\n谩取黄金建厦，繁华梦、毕竟空虚。\n争如且、寒村厨火，汤饼一斋盂。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53052,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"张耒","text":"倾盖相逢汝水滨。\n须知见面过闻名。\n马头虽去无千里，酒盏才倾且百分。\n嗟得失，一微尘。\n莫教冰炭损精神。\n北扉西禁须公等，金榜当年第一人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53053,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"张耒","text":"飞蚊绕枕细而轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53054,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"张耒","text":"逢君金华宴，正味百花先。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53055,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"张耒","text":"昔日陶公宅，今为释子居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53056,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"张耒","text":"霜橙共我乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53057,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"张耒","text":"淮山二十里，秀色已在户。\n舟车走梁宋，烟树引吴楚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53058,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"张耒","text":"灵橘无根井有泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53059,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"张耒","text":"鹄壳攒修干，金华耀暖曦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53060,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"张耒","text":"须看远山相对蹙，莫欺病齿恼衰翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53061,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劳歌","author":"张耒","text":"暑天三月元无雨，云头不合惟飞土。\n深堂无人午睡馀，欲动身先汗如雨。\n忽怜长街负重民，筋骸长彀十石弩。\n半衲遮背是生涯，以力受金饱儿女。\n人家牛马系高木，惟恐牛躯犯炎酷。\n天工作民良久艰，谁知不如牛马福。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53062,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丹霞岩","author":"张自明","text":"玉玲珑外玉崔巍，曾与三贤识面来。\n自有此山才有此，游人于此合裴回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53063,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白龙洞","author":"张自明","text":"白龙洞口白龙台，一俯南天眼豁开。\n苍壁漫题三数字，后人还笑我曾来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53064,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观邸报","author":"张自明","text":"西风飒飒雨潇潇，小小人家短短桥。\n独倚阑干数鹅匹，一声孤雁在云霄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53065,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水月洞","author":"张自明","text":"癸水江头石似浮，银河影里月如钩。\n无人弄杵看蟾兔，有客乘槎访斗牛。\n自古鹊桥传七日，何年桂子落三秋。\n金轮待欲长无缺，玉斧仍须妙手修。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53066,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和方信孺题云崖轩","author":"张自明","text":"万里风烟倚瘦藜，湘南曾自一登陴。\n云崖知在宜山麓，水月传誇古洞奇。\n四字丹书无梦见，千峰苍玉有谁诗。\n门前系马松阴下，鸦背斜阳影屡移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53067,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"栖霞洞","author":"张自明","text":"玉洞沉沉锁碧虚，月华曾伴日华居。\n刀圭影触金丸弹，蝉蜕形留锦鲤鱼。\n旧隐已荒三径草，仙人忽授数行书。\n丹霞自有栖真处，十里松风可跨驴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53068,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清秀山次韵","author":"张自明","text":"甲子循环各一时，又逢青犬护岩扉。\n金墉城锁瑶池苑，苍玉楼铺锦地衣。\n万里西风生木末，数声湘竹叫云归。\n明朝天上秋期近，问讯河边织女机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53069,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游华景洞","author":"张自明","text":"拂破苍苔觅旧题，五言觅得晚唐诗。\n岩光人忆遗名好，华景天开一段奇。\n铁锁掣关躔壁垒，玉梯穿路透瑶池。\n古心未展閒游戏，惭愧平生华子期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53070,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游朝阳洞次孙机宜韵 其一","author":"张自明","text":"绿野年来喜有秋，行春到处小淹留。\n朝阳亭上初披雾，水月岩中更枕流。\n竹径不容周俗驾，桃蹊还泊晋渔舟。\n遨头自愧非元老，滥总师干乏壮猷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53071,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游朝阳洞次孙机宜韵 其二","author":"张自明","text":"乘轺初至忆前秋，岂意持麾尚此留。\n立屋得僧成宴喜，游山如谢欠风流。\n劝酬同把菊花盏，来往自操莲叶舟。\n向晚洞门烟渐锁，祗应归兴更宜犹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53072,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子期台","author":"张至龙","text":"拾叶题诗愧不才，袖遮微日上层台。\n山僧分我松阴坐，隔岸花香渡水来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53073,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山矾花","author":"张至龙","text":"漫山白蕊殿春华，多贮清香野老家。\n频向风前招蝶使，密通家籍省梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53074,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马升庵惠鞠苗","author":"张至龙","text":"税得邻东地一方，旋栽黄鞠待重阳。\n春晨摘落青苗叶，挼作秋花气味香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53075,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"化龙阁","author":"张至龙","text":"镌满留题屋柱间，风吹醉面不知寒。\n渔舟撑出垂杨岸，惊鹭衔鱼过别滩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53076,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巴岭","author":"张至龙","text":"处处柴门掩半边，莺啼绿树隔炊烟。\n竹梯闲倚柔桑畔，定是人家蚕正眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53077,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东林寺","author":"张至龙","text":"满院香风乍熟楂，猴孙抱子坐枯槎。\n头陀不惯迎宾客，自折芙蓉供释迦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53078,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊蝶","author":"张至龙","text":"数日偎红翅力慵，化成长梦别春风。\n却怜蚁为埋香玉，舁入残花土穴中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53079,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟韩偓体","author":"张至龙","text":"一声阿鹊颤鸾双，学调新词未得腔。\n拜了夜香郎唤睡，旋收针线背银釭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53080,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其一","author":"张至龙","text":"荷叶笼头学道情，花妆那似妾妆清。\n双双头白犹交颈，翻笑鸳鸯不老成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53081,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中过陆家园","author":"张至龙","text":"斜搭鞦韆窗半扃，行人屐送隔墙声。\n群花相倚啼妆面，苦不催晴怨懒莺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53082,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饯翁丹山发南浦","author":"张至龙","text":"鸣鸠语燕近清明，柳絮风轻秧水平。\n一带春流多断岸，尽缘倒树当桥行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53083,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿灵岩","author":"张至龙","text":"树杪钟楼出半层，佛床黠鼠弄残灯。\n五更石上僧犹定，头满清霜唤不应。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53084,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿易冲妙道院","author":"张至龙","text":"松发经寒乱不梳，夜来风减屋茆疏。\n吟边冻指僵如铁，袖裹枯筇画雪书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53085,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚窗","author":"张至龙","text":"风约钟声落耳根，归鸦点点不成群。\n前山野烧青烟起，散满空中作暮云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53086,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花十咏 其十 大实","author":"张至龙","text":"圆碧日益肥，磊落压枝重。\n虽然苦味酸，酸中藏大用。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53087,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓兴十首 其八","author":"张至龙","text":"高风吹秋霜，庭前百草死。\n谁知草有根，昨夜东风起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53088,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓兴十首 其六","author":"张至龙","text":"庭前无繁植，疏竹附梅坡。\n虽然无巨荫，明月飞来多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53089,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]